  message: "Producer xml_config.py:_process_android_application now emits kind=\"component\" with meta[\"component_type\"] = activity/service/receiver/provider. config-conventions.yaml's 4 android_component rules migrated to ^component$ + meta_match. Provider routing: Android <provider> goes through component+meta to keep canonical \"provider\" kind (Apex/Salesforce) cleanly disjoint. Tests updated in lockstep: test_xml_analyzer.py, BRANCHES_test_xml_config.py, test_framework_patterns.py + 4 new TestConfigConventionsMigratedRules pinning tests. 10326 tests pass at 100% coverage. Merged in commit d6d8df52ae."  # 60e4
